  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 611.11 Jurisdiction. Pursuant to RSA 622:45, IV, persons admitted or transferred to the unit shall be under the care and custody of the corrections commissioner and the medical unit director and shall be subject to the rules of the corrections commissioner.\n\nSource. #7299, eff 5-25-00, EXPIRED: 5-25-08\n\nNew. #9229, EMERGENCY, eff 8-5-08, EXPIRES: 2-1-09; ss by #9371, eff 2-1-09, EXPIRED: 2-1-17\n\nNew. #12104, INTERIM, eff 2-14-17, EXPIRES: 8-13-17; ss by #12341, eff 7-25-17; renumbered by #13255 (formerly He-M 611.11)",
